msgid "# runtime_config"
msgstr "# runtime_config"

msgid ""
"JSON schema for Runtime Guard. Default path: "
"`<cwd>/runtime/config/runtime_config.json`."
msgstr ""
"Runtime Guard 的 JSON schema。默认路径：`<cwd>/runtime/config/runtime_config.json`。"

msgid ""
"Defaults are defined in code (`runtime_config._defaults`); JSONC comments "
"are supported if you hand-edit the live file."
msgstr "默认值在代码中定义（`runtime_config._defaults`）；手动编辑实时文件时支持 JSONC 注释。"

msgid ""
"**Startup overwrite:** on worker start the JSON writer materializes defaults"
" ← `additional_config.runtime_config` overlay and **overwrites** any pre-"
"existing file. Hand-edits made *before* start are lost unless they are in "
"the overlay. Prefer: start with `runtime_config_hot_reload=true`, then edit "
"the live file (or set the watermark via overlay)."
msgstr ""
"**启动时覆盖：** worker 启动时，JSON 写入器会将默认值 ← `additional_config.runtime_config` "
"覆盖层实例化，并**覆盖**任何已存在的文件。启动*之前*所做的手动编辑会丢失，除非它们位于覆盖层中。推荐做法：以 "
"`runtime_config_hot_reload=true` 启动，然后编辑实时文件（或通过覆盖层设置水位线）。"

msgid ""
"Startup keys (`runtime_config_path`, `runtime_config_hot_reload`, overlay "
"dict) are documented in [Additional "
"Configuration](./additional_config.md#runtime_guard)."
msgstr ""
"启动键（`runtime_config_path`、`runtime_config_hot_reload`、覆盖层字典）记录在[附加配置](./additional_config.md#runtime_guard)中。"

msgid "## Top-level keys"
msgstr "## 顶层键"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid "| `actions` | object | see below | Default incident actions |"
msgstr "| `actions` | object | 见下文 | 默认事件动作 |"

msgid ""
"| `dump` | object | see below | Auto dump quota and manual dump controls |"
msgstr "| `dump` | object | 见下文 | 自动 dump 配额和手动 dump 控制 |"

msgid "| `ascend_log` | object | see below | Ascend logger level overrides |"
msgstr "| `ascend_log` | object | 见下文 | 昇腾日志级别覆盖 |"

msgid "| `report` | object | see below | Report content and truncation |"
msgstr "| `report` | object | 见下文 | 报告内容和截断 |"

msgid "| `detector` | object | see below | Detector sections + shared flags |"
msgstr "| `detector` | object | 见下文 | 检测器配置段 + 共享标志 |"

msgid ""
"Hot-reload is **startup-only** "
"(`additional_config.runtime_config_hot_reload`); it is not a JSON field. "
"Sync transport is fixed: **last-PP × all TP** use the merged due bus; other "
"processes poll this JSON file."
msgstr ""
"热重载是**仅启动时**的（`additional_config.runtime_config_hot_reload`）；它不是 JSON "
"字段。同步传输方式是固定的：**last-PP × all TP** 使用合并的 due 总线；其他进程轮询此 JSON 文件。"

msgid "## actions"
msgstr "## actions"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid ""
"| `defaults.on_trigger` | list[str] | `[\"report\"]` | Actions when a "
"detector section omits `on_trigger` |"
msgstr ""
"| `defaults.on_trigger` | list[str] | `[\"report\"]` | 当检测器配置段省略 "
"`on_trigger` 时的动作 |"

msgid ""
"Valid action names: `report`, `dump_kv`. ActionQueue capacity is a fixed "
"internal constant (not exposed in JSON)."
msgstr "有效的动作名称：`report`、`dump_kv`。ActionQueue 容量是固定的内部常量（不在 JSON 中暴露）。"

msgid "## dump"
msgstr "## dump"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid ""
"| `auto_max_times` | int | `0` | Max auto `dump_kv` captures per process "
"lifetime. `0` disables auto dump quota |"
msgstr ""
"| `auto_max_times` | int | `0` | 每个进程生命周期内自动 `dump_kv` 捕获的最大次数。`0` 禁用自动 dump"
" 配额 |"

msgid ""
"| `auto_cooldown_seconds` | float | `300` | Minimum seconds between auto "
"dumps after a **successful** quota consume (refund clears this cooldown) |"
msgstr ""
"| `auto_cooldown_seconds` | float | `300` | **成功**消耗配额后自动 dump "
"之间的最小秒数（退还配额会清除此冷却） |"

msgid ""
"| `manual_dump` | bool \\| int | `false` | Manual dump watermark: `false`, "
"positive int N (catch-up: dump once per armed wave while process `done < N`;"
" **prefer bump 1→2→3**), or `true` (continuous; **not recommended**). Never "
"rewritten by the process. If disk value ≤ `done`, skip. Setting N=5 with "
"`done=0` fires about five dumps across subsequent waves. Reports / `.pt` "
"carry `manual_dump_count` (1-based seq). Multi-DP: each replica tracks its "
"own `done`. **Ops:** start the server first, then raise N in the live JSON "
"(hot-reload required). |"
msgstr ""
"| `manual_dump` | bool \\| int | `false` | 手动 dump 水位线：`false`、正整数 "
"N（追赶模式：当进程 `done < N` 时，每个已武装的 wave dump 一次；**推荐逐步递增 1→2→3**），或 "
"`true`（持续；**不推荐**）。进程永远不会重写它。如果磁盘值 ≤ `done`，则跳过。设置 N=5 且 `done=0` 时，会在后续 "
"wave 中触发约五次 dump。报告 / `.pt` 携带 `manual_dump_count`（从 1 开始的序号）。多 DP：每个副本跟踪自己的"
" `done`。**运维：** 先启动服务器，然后在实时 JSON 中提高 N（需要热重载）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `dump_dir` | str \\| null | derived | KV dump root (default "
"`<report_dir>/kv_cache`). Layout: "
"`<dump_root>/<incident_type>/<req_id>/dp*_tp*_pp*_cp*/*.pt`. Coverage is "
"last PP × all TP (not other PP). |"
msgstr ""
"| `dump_dir` | str \\| null | 派生 | KV dump 根目录（默认 "
"`<report_dir>/kv_cache`）。布局：`<dump_root>/<incident_type>/<req_id>/dp*_tp*_pp*_cp*/*.pt`。覆盖范围为"
" last PP × all TP（不包括其他 PP）。 |"

msgid ""
"Free-space headroom for `dump_kv` (`estimated payload + headroom`) is a "
"fixed internal constant (5 GiB), not a JSON field."
msgstr ""
"`dump_kv` 的可用空间余量（`estimated payload + headroom`）是固定的内部常量（5 GiB），不是 JSON 字段。"

msgid ""
"Manual dump / manual trigger skip auto quota and cooldown. Requires "
"`runtime_config_hot_reload=true`."
msgstr "手动 dump / 手动触发会跳过自动配额和冷却。需要 `runtime_config_hot_reload=true`。"

msgid "## report"
msgstr "## report"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid ""
"| `save_sensitive_info` | bool | `false` | Persist prompt/output token ids "
"**and** decode them to text |"
msgstr ""
"| `save_sensitive_info` | bool | `false` | 持久化 prompt/output token id "
"**并**将其解码为文本 |"

msgid ""
"| `max_prompt_token_ids` | int | `100000` | Truncate persisted prompt ids "
"(`0` = unlimited) |"
msgstr ""
"| `max_prompt_token_ids` | int | `100000` | 截断持久化的 prompt id（`0` = 不限制） |"

msgid ""
"| `max_output_token_ids` | int | `100000` | Truncate persisted output ids |"
msgstr "| `max_output_token_ids` | int | `100000` | 截断持久化的 output id |"

msgid ""
"| `max_per_req` | int | `1` | Max report files per `(incident_type, "
"req_id)`; at cap, stop detecting that request. Wave backoff (64×2ⁿ) between "
"writes when cap &gt; 1 |"
msgstr ""
"| `max_per_req` | int | `1` | 每个 `(incident_type, req_id)` "
"的最大报告文件数；达到上限后，停止检测该请求。当上限 &gt; 1 时，写入之间采用 wave 退避（64×2ⁿ） |"

msgid ""
"GPU `block_ids` are always included in report detail. Decoding token ids to "
"text follows `save_sensitive_info` (no separate toggle)."
msgstr ""
"GPU `block_ids` 始终包含在报告详情中。将 token id 解码为文本遵循 "
"`save_sensitive_info`（没有单独的开关）。"

msgid ""
"`[SamplingMeta]` is emitted at DEBUG on the after-sample path (TP0 + last "
"PP). Enable with `ascend_log` / logger level for "
"`vllm_ascend.observability.runtime_guard` — there is no JSON toggle."
msgstr ""
"`[SamplingMeta]` 在 after-sample 路径（TP0 + last PP）上以 DEBUG 级别输出。通过 "
"`ascend_log` / `vllm_ascend.observability.runtime_guard` 的 logger 级别启用——没有 "
"JSON 开关。"

msgid "## ascend_log"
msgstr "## ascend_log"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid "| `level` | str | `\"INFO\"` | Base Ascend log level |"
msgstr "| `level` | str | `\"INFO\"` | 基础昇腾日志级别 |"

msgid ""
"| `debug` | list[str] | `[]` | Module path prefixes forced to DEBUG under "
"`vllm_ascend` |"
msgstr "| `debug` | list[str] | `[]` | 在 `vllm_ascend` 下强制为 DEBUG 的模块路径前缀 |"

msgid ""
"| `modules` | object | `{}` | Per-logger overrides, e.g. `{\"vllm.worker\": "
"\"WARNING\"}` |"
msgstr ""
"| `modules` | object | `{}` | 按 logger 的覆盖，例如 `{\"vllm.worker\": "
"\"WARNING\"}` |"

msgid "## detector (shared)"
msgstr "## detector（共享）"

msgid ""
"Stop-detect is controlled by ``report.max_per_req`` (write-full), not a shared detector flag.\n"
"Default ``actions.defaults.on_trigger`` includes ``report``."
msgstr ""
"停止检测由 ``report.max_per_req``（写满）控制，而不是共享的检测器标志。\n"
"默认 ``actions.defaults.on_trigger`` 包含 ``report``。"

msgid ""
"Detector JSON sections are declared on each detector class (``schema``) and\n"
"registered in ``runtime_config.detector_catalog`` — add/remove a detector there\n"
"to refresh defaults, validation, and control-panel field lists."
msgstr ""
"检测器 JSON 配置段在每个检测器类（``schema``）上声明，并\n"
"注册在 ``runtime_config.detector_catalog`` 中——在那里添加/移除检测器\n"
"即可刷新默认值、校验和控制面板字段列表。"

msgid "Each nested detector section supports:"
msgstr "每个嵌套的检测器配置段支持："

msgid "| Key | Type | Description |"
msgstr "| 键 | 类型 | 描述 |"

msgid "| `enabled` | bool | Master switch (default `false`) |"
msgstr "| `enabled` | bool | 总开关（默认 `false`） |"

msgid "| `on_trigger` | list[str] | Override actions for this incident type |"
msgstr "| `on_trigger` | list[str] | 覆盖此事件类型的动作 |"

msgid ""
"| `dump_kv` | object | Per-type dump options: `scope` (`request` \\| "
"`all_requests`). Finish-wave arms still dump; artifacts may set "
"`request_finished_at_dump: true` (KV may already be freed/reused — treat as "
"suspect). |"
msgstr ""
"| `dump_kv` | object | 按类型的 dump 选项：`scope`（`request` \\| "
"`all_requests`）。Finish-wave 武装仍会 dump；产物可能设置 `request_finished_at_dump: "
"true`（KV 可能已被释放/复用——应视为可疑）。 |"

msgid "### spec_acceptance"
msgstr "### spec_acceptance"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid "| `window` | int | `10` | Rolling window size |"
msgstr "| `window` | int | `10` | 滚动窗口大小 |"

msgid "| `low_threshold` | float | `0.3` | Low acceptance rate threshold |"
msgstr "| `low_threshold` | float | `0.3` | 低接受率阈值 |"

msgid "| `len_low_threshold` | float | `1.4` | Length ratio at low rate |"
msgstr "| `len_low_threshold` | float | `1.4` | 低接受率时的长度比 |"

msgid "| `high_threshold` | float | `0.96` | High acceptance rate threshold |"
msgstr "| `high_threshold` | float | `0.96` | 高接受率阈值 |"

msgid "| `len_high_threshold` | float | `2.8` | Length ratio at high rate |"
msgstr "| `len_high_threshold` | float | `2.8` | 高接受率下的长度比 |"

msgid ""
"Per-req INFO short-log throttle is a fixed internal interval (2s), not a "
"JSON field."
msgstr "每请求 INFO 短日志节流是固定的内部间隔（2 秒），不是 JSON 字段。"

msgid "### token_repeat"
msgstr "### token_repeat"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid "| `window` | int | `32` | Sliding content window |"
msgstr "| `window` | int | `32` | 滑动内容窗口 |"

msgid ""
"| `repeat_sum_threshold` | int | `64` | Alert when sum of repeat scores "
"exceeds this |"
msgstr "| `repeat_sum_threshold` | int | `64` | 当重复分数之和超过此值时告警 |"

msgid "| `min_tokens` | int | `32` | Minimum content tokens before alerting |"
msgstr "| `min_tokens` | int | `32` | 触发告警前的最小内容 token 数 |"

msgid ""
"| `consecutive_hits` | int | `1` | Required consecutive over-threshold steps"
" |"
msgstr "| `consecutive_hits` | int | `1` | 所需的连续超阈值步数 |"

msgid ""
"| `ignore_token_ids` | list[int] | `[]` | Token ids excluded from window "
"scoring |"
msgstr "| `ignore_token_ids` | list[int] | `[]` | 从窗口评分中排除的 token id |"

msgid "### logits_finite"
msgstr "### logits_finite"

msgid "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| Key | Type | Default | Description |"

msgid ""
"| `enabled` | bool | `false` | Alert on NaN/Inf logits before sampling |"
msgstr "| `enabled` | bool | `false` | 在采样前对 NaN/Inf logits 告警 |"

msgid ""
"| `item_sync` | bool | `false` | `false`: async `.item()` — non-blocking D2H"
" of the all-finite gate at pre-sample; wait in after-sample / `get_output`. "
"**Logits may be mutated afterward** (e.g. grammar bitmask writes `-inf`); "
"the gate still uses precomputed `row_finite`, but hit-time `finite_kind` may"
" reflect post-mutation values. `true`: blocking `.item()` (+ hit resolve) at"
" pre-sample so gate and kind match **pre-grammar** logits. |"
msgstr ""
"| `item_sync` | bool | `false` | `false`：异步 `.item()` —— 在预采样时对全有限门控进行非阻塞 "
"D2H；在采样后 / `get_output` 中等待。**Logits 之后可能被修改**（例如 grammar 位掩码写入 "
"`-inf`）；门控仍使用预计算的 `row_finite`，但命中时的 `finite_kind` "
"可能反映修改后的值。`true`：在预采样时进行阻塞式 `.item()`（+ 命中解析），使门控和 kind 与 **grammar 之前**的 "
"logits 一致。 |"

msgid ""
"Deferred alert-batch queue cap is a fixed internal constant, not a JSON "
"field."
msgstr "延迟告警批次队列上限是固定的内部常量，不是 JSON 字段。"

msgid ""
"Each step runs a device ``isfinite`` reduction and one all-finite gate. Default\n"
"path launches a non-blocking host copy of that gate and waits in\n"
"``check_deferred``. On a hit only, bad rows / ``logits_indices`` / ``finite_kind``\n"
"are resolved (indices are snapshotted at pre-sample when needed). Set\n"
"``item_sync: true`` when you need kind/attribution against pristine pre-sample\n"
"logits. Retired: ``check_every_tokens`` (multi-step window) — ignored if present."
msgstr ""
"每一步都会执行一次设备端 ``isfinite`` 归约和一个全有限门控。默认路径会启动该门控的非阻塞主机拷贝，并在 "
"``check_deferred`` 中等待。仅在命中时，才会解析坏行 / ``logits_indices`` / "
"``finite_kind``（需要时会在预采样时对索引进行快照）。当你需要针对原始预采样 logits 进行 kind/归因时，请设置 "
"``item_sync: true``。已废弃：``check_every_tokens``（多步窗口）—— 如果存在则忽略。"

msgid "### manual_trigger"
msgstr "### manual_trigger"

msgid ""
"Not a detector — control-plane for `dump.manual_dump`. Always runs `dump_kv`"
" over the live batch (`scope=all_requests`; configured `dump_kv.scope` is "
"ignored). `on_trigger` may still list `report` / other actions; if omitted, "
"`actions.defaults` apply and `dump_kv` is injected."
msgstr ""
"不是检测器 —— 而是 `dump.manual_dump` 的控制平面。始终对实时批次运行 "
"`dump_kv`（`scope=all_requests`；配置的 `dump_kv.scope` 会被忽略）。`on_trigger` 仍可列出 "
"`report` / 其他动作；如果省略，则应用 `actions.defaults` 并注入 `dump_kv`。"

msgid ""
"**Prefer `dump.manual_dump: 1` then bump to `2`, `3`, … for another "
"capture** (after the server is already running with hot-reload). Continuous "
"`true` / large jumps add little for debugging and can flood the action queue"
" and disk (`N=5` with `done=0` catch-up-dumps across ~5 waves)."
msgstr ""
"**优先使用 `dump.manual_dump: 1`，然后递增到 `2`、`3`、…… 以进行另一次捕获**（在服务器已通过热重载运行之后）。持续 "
"`true` / 大幅跳变对调试帮助不大，并且可能淹没动作队列和磁盘（`N=5` 且 `done=0` 时，会在约 5 个波次中进行追赶式 dump）。"

msgid ""
"`N` is a **watermark**, not a remaining counter. The process keeps an in-"
"memory `done` count (never written back to JSON). While `done < N`, each "
"armed wave with scheduled tokens fires one dump and bumps `done` (even if "
"`dump_kv` fails to queue — skip marker still written). If the value on disk "
"is ≤ `done`, no dump. To dump again after finishing, raise `N` above `done`."
" Reports and dump payloads include `manual_dump_count` (1-based seq for that"
" wave) and `manual_dump_target`. Multi-DP sharing one file: each replica "
"tracks its own `done`."
msgstr ""
"`N` 是一个**水位线**，而不是剩余计数器。进程会维护一个内存中的 `done` 计数（绝不会写回 JSON）。当 `done < N` "
"时，每个已武装且带有计划 token 的波次都会触发一次 dump 并递增 `done`（即使 `dump_kv` 入队失败 —— "
"仍会写入跳过标记）。如果磁盘上的值 ≤ `done`，则不进行 dump。若要在完成后再次 dump，请将 `N` 提高到 `done` 之上。报告和 "
"dump 负载包含 `manual_dump_count`（该波次的从 1 开始的序号）和 `manual_dump_target`。多个 DP "
"共享一个文件时：每个副本跟踪各自的 `done`。"

